WEBVTT

00:14:29.628 --> 00:14:31.895
Goodbye for now, my love. Bye bye.

00:14:32.371 --> 00:14:35.569
(Music)

00:14:39.883 --> 00:14:41.033
(Music ends)

00:14:42.264 --> 00:14:44.705
AC: When he listened
to that recording in his cell

00:14:44.729 --> 00:14:46.893
before it was sent out to his daughter,

00:14:46.917 --> 00:14:48.148
he cried.

00:14:48.172 --> 00:14:50.613
And that's a pretty common
reaction from prisoners,

00:14:50.637 --> 00:14:52.445
as they realize for the first time

00:14:52.469 --> 00:14:54.777
they've been able
to do something for their child

00:14:54.801 --> 00:14:56.815
which they never thought they could.

00:14:57.784 --> 00:15:01.031
They've connected
in the most fundamental way,